"section":"Writing Homework 3","title":"","html":"<div class=\"obj\" data-id=\"11\" data-name=\"module\" style=\"left:108px;top:39px;width:1080px;height:37.5px;\"><div class=\"text\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;justify-content:flex-start\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:27px;color:#BD3A08;font-weight:700;\">WRITING</span></p></div></div><div class=\"obj\" data-id=\"2\" data-name=\"heading\" style=\"left:108px;top:94.5px;width:1350px;height:70.5px;\"><div class=\"text\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;justify-content:flex-start\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:51px;color:#193C78;font-weight:700;\">Writing Homework 3</span></p></div></div><div class=\"obj\" data-id=\"4\" data-name=\"subheading\" style=\"left:108px;top:181.5px;width:1680px;height:51px;\"><div class=\"text\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;justify-content:flex-start\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:34.5px;color:#193C78;font-weight:400;\">Questions 12</span></p></div></div><div class=\"obj\" data-id=\"5\" data-name=\"question-1\" style=\"left:108px;top:261px;width:1704px;height:198px;\"><div class=\"text\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;justify-content:flex-start\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:37.5px;color:#192B3B;font-weight:400;\">12. Order a fictional service timeline.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:37.5px;color:#192B3B;font-weight:400;\">A. It later added scooter repairs to that service.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:37.5px;color:#192B3B;font-weight:400;\">B. Today, both repair services are available at two branches.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:37.5px;color:#192B3B;font-weight:400;\">C. The company began by repairing bicycles.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"obj layer\" data-id=\"6\" data-name=\"answer-1\" hidden style=\"left:108px;top:459px;width:1704px;height:63px;\"><div class=\"text\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;justify-content:flex-start\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:37.5px;color:#C00000;font-weight:700;\">C–A–B</span></p></div></div><div class=\"obj layer\" data-id=\"7\" data-name=\"evidence-1\" hidden style=\"left:108px;top:522px;width:1704px;height:90px;\"><div class=\"text\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;justify-content:flex-start\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;color:#193C78;font-weight:400;\">依据：The company began by repairing bicycles. It later added scooter repairs to that service. Today, both repair services are available at two branches.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"obj layer\" data-id=\"8\" data-name=\"explanation-1\" hidden style=\"left:108px;top:612px;width:1704px;height:90px;\"><div class=\"text\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;justify-content:flex-start\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;color:#192B3B;font-weight:400;\">解析：顺序 C–A–B。先有 bicycle repair，之后加入 scooter repairs；只有两项服务都已出现，B 的 both repair services 才有明确所指。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"obj\" data-id=\"9\" data-name=\"footer-source\" style=\"left:108px;top:1024.5px;width:1050px;height:34.5px;\"><div class=\"text\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;justify-content:flex-start\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:22.5px;color:#64748B;font-weight:400;\">UNLOCK 2 RW   UNIT 6   BUSINESS</span></p></div></div><div class=\"obj\" data-id=\"10\" data-name=\"footer-page\" style=\"left:1342.5px;top:1024.5px;width:469.5px;height:34.5px;\"><div class=\"text\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;justify-content:flex-start\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:22.5px;color:#64748B;font-weight:400;\">W H3 · 讲评   266</span></p></div></div>","controls":[{"id":"12","label":"答案12","effects":[["6",true]]},{"id":"13","label":"解析12","effects":[["7",true],["8",true]]},{"id":"14","label":"题面12","effects":[["6",false],["7",false],["8",false]]},{"id":"reset","label":"题面","reset":true}]